cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Padiush Companion in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "Padiush Companion"
abstract: >-
  The mobile field-capture application for the Padiush platform. It records
  interviews entirely offline — answers, audio, photographs and location — in
  an encrypted on-device store, and synchronises them when connectivity allows.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
